Go!

277
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,040
Right.

278
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:48,040
I've got to do this for my wish.

279
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:51,040
I feel really bad about what happened to Hitoe.

280
00:15:51,040 --> 00:15:52,040
But...

281
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:56,040
Her wish was something that could come true without being a selector.

282
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,840
But mine?

283
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:59,840
There's nothing I can do.

284
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,840
People will always frown on it.

285
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:02,840
I need power.

286
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:04,840
I need a miracle!

287
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:06,840
Yuzuki.

288
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,840
Since you've made your decision,

289
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:11,840
let us join together for one final attack.

290
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:24,640
Now, the oath.

291
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:25,640
Do you remember it?

292
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:26,640
Yeah.

293
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:27,640
It's a…

294
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:28,640
I accept…

295
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:30,640
The Laws of the Selector.

296
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:33,640
I accept the Laws of the Selector.

297
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:34,640
And…

298
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:39,640
And upon this sacred oath, a new Eternal Girl shall be born!

299
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,440
A Domestere!

300
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:52,440
Is this…

301
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,440
It is the birth…

302
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:55,440
Of a new Eternal Girl.

303
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:04,440
What?

304
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,440
Wait…

305
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:06,440
What's happening?

306
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:14,440
Who cares?

307
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:27,440
It's your day off from school, Ruu!

308
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:29,440
Wouldn't you rather be playing your card game?

309
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,440
Nah…

310
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:34,340
I always have a good time with you no matter what we do.

311
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:45,040
And besides, we cross-battles might be fun, but after seeing all the pain they cause, I... I...

312
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:46,600
We can't be friends anymore.

313
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:49,880
What is it?

314
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:53,600
Nothing. Just trying to swallow a hiccup.

315
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:55,200
All right.

316
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:58,020
I have to stay away from those cars.

317
00:18:04,340 --> 00:18:05,000
Hello?

318
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,140
Dude, why did you take off like that?

319
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:11,840
Onika's pretty ticked. She said you treated her like crap. You gotta apologize.

320
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:15,840
I'll help you smooth things over, but get back here, right?

321
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:18,840
Why are girls such drama queens?

322
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,840
Yuzuki's not like that.

323
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:24,340
She's always smiling.

324
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:26,540
And honest, too.

325
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:30,840
Even if she's upset, she tries to keep it to herself.

326
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:36,840
Duh! That you and Yuzuki are like doing stuff!

327
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:39,840
No, that's crazy.

328
00:18:46,340 --> 00:18:47,340
Hey, I'm home.

329
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:53,840
Yuzuki? What happened?

330
00:18:55,340 --> 00:18:56,840
Just got dizzy for a moment.

331
00:18:57,840 --> 00:18:59,340
Sorry, I'll be fine.

332
00:18:59,340 --> 00:19:01,040
Look, you better lie down.

333
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:02,540
Can you walk?

334
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:08,340
Thank you, Kazuki.

335
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,540
No problem.

336
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:15,340
Did you put something on?

337
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:16,840
What?

338
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:18,840
Like perfume?

339
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:20,340
You smell nice.

340
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:27,840
You know, they say if you like someone's natural smell, that person is the love of your life.

341
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:28,840
Huh?

342
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:33,040
I didn't come up with the idea. Just saying, that's all.

343
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:35,840
Come on, what are you talking about?

344
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:38,940
If you're trying to make me laugh, this is just kind of awkward.

345
00:19:38,940 --> 00:19:42,440
Even if you like your family, the love of your life is someone else.

346
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:43,940
And if I was someone else?

347
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,440
Other than my twin?

348
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:54,440
We were born as two halves of one whole, so in order for us to be complete, maybe we just need to be together.

349
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:59,940
Something's not right.

350
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:00,940
With who?

351
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:03,440
You, my friends.

352
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:06,440
Did someone say something to you?

353
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:11,440
You can talk to me about anything, all right?

354
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:15,440
Kazuki, I'm yours if you need me.

355
00:20:18,940 --> 00:20:20,440
Now and forever.

356
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,440
Can I come in?

357
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,940
Hitoi, did you eat, dear?

358
00:20:45,940 --> 00:20:47,940
No, not even the lunch I brought you?

359
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:50,440
Sweetie, you have to eat something.

360
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:54,940
Oh, before I forget, I got a little gift for you.

361
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,440
Take a look.

362
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:59,440
You like this game, don't you?

363
00:20:59,940 --> 00:21:04,440
I saw an ad about a new WeCross deck being released, so I thought I'd get you one to cheer you up.

364
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:07,440
Why don't you flip through it and see what you got?

365
00:21:07,940 --> 00:21:09,440
Oh, I bought a cake also.

366
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:12,940
Tell you what, I'm gonna bring up a big ol' slice for you, okay?

367
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:13,940
Be right back.

368
00:21:13,940 --> 00:21:14,440
Be back.

369
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,440
Ah!

370
00:21:19,940 --> 00:21:20,440
Ah.

371
00:21:24,940 --> 00:21:25,940
Oh, God.

372
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:29,940
To be gone now, we installed aお!

373
00:21:30,940 --> 00:21:32,940
No, no, no.

374
00:21:32,940 --> 00:21:33,940
Here we go.

375
00:21:34,940 --> 00:21:36,440
Why not wait?

376
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:52,720
Nice to meet you, Selector.

377
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:24,200
終わりのドアが開き始まる闇 危うい答えそこに見え隠れる 今日の祈りは明日多分になる

378
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:35,880
天と地を映す 逆園の迷路 回り出した 歯車

379
00:22:35,880 --> 00:22:51,320
人ごみの中で 耳を澄ましたら 魂を招く あの鈴の音 響く空へ

380
00:22:51,320 --> 00:23:04,440
無限の果てまでも 進むしかない 自分で選んだ 未来だから

381
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:16,120
届かない今すぐも 揺れる陽炎を いつか取り戻す 笑顔の場所

382
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:27,320
次回の動画でお会いしましょう

383
00:23:27,320 --> 00:23:33,320
次回の動画でお会いしましょう

384
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:39,320
次回の動画でお会いしましょう

385
00:23:39,320 --> 00:23:45,320
次回の動画でお会いしましょう

